# Created by https://www.toptal.com/developers/gitignore/api/rust
# Edit at https://www.toptal.com/developers/gitignore?templates=rust

### Rust ###
# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
debug/
target/

# Oxvim is a binary: Cargo.lock is committed, not ignored.

# The upstream Neovim checkout is the read-only executable specification, not
# our source: a separate clone of another project's history, plus its build
# tree and the oracle binary. Fetch it with `git clone
# https://github.com/neovim/neovim.git .references/neovim` and build the
# oracle with `make CMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=RelWithDebInfo`.
.references/

# These are backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

# MSVC Windows builds of rustc generate these, which store debugging information
*.pdb

# End of https://www.toptal.com/developers/gitignore/api/rust

# === AI TOOLING ===
# AI agent scratch / plan artifacts (safe to ignore in all repos)
# Durable project records live under .outline and must be tracked: they are the
# only account of what each task changed and why, and a lost checkout took the
# untracked ones with it. Ignore the directory's contents rather than the
# directory, so the exceptions below can be reached.
.outline/*
!.outline/sdd/
.outline/sdd/*
!.outline/sdd/reports/
!.outline/sdd/briefs/
!.outline/sdd/progress.md
!.outline/sdd/oldtest-census.tsv
!.outline/sdd/oldtest-blockers.md
!.outline/sdd/oldtest-census-2.tsv
!.outline/sdd/oldtest-blockers-2.md
!.outline/sdd/oldtest-census-3.tsv
!.outline/sdd/oldtest-blockers-3.md
!.outline/sdd/plugin-probe.md
!.outline/sdd/functional-census.tsv
!.outline/sdd/functional-blockers.md
.plan/
PLAN.md
TASKS.md

# Aider runtime state (safe to ignore in all repos)
.aider.chat.history.md
.aider.input.history
.aider.tags.cache.v*/

